      "body": {
        "serial": "container_containeritembody_5e984c282713d692602240",
        "body": "\n    <div class=\"grid-row\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\"><p><strong>Math<\/strong><\/p><p>7 + 12 =\u00a0\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2827d45454493339}}\u00a0<\/p><p>15 - 4\u00a0=\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2827e09340022892}}\u00a0<\/p><p>5 \u00d7 8 =\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2827eb2267912084}}\u00a0<\/p><p>16\u00a0\u00f7 4\u00a0=\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2827f56343602670}}\u00a0\u00a0<\/p><p>3<sup>3\u00a0<\/sup>=\u00a0\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2827ff8356630428}}\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><strong>Poetry contest<\/strong><\/p>\nThere once was a student from\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2828098482072271}}\u00a0\u00a0\n\n<p>Who spent his free time playing\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c2828136288725391}}\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\n<p>He \u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c28281dd903956088}}\u00a0his grades<\/p>\n\n<p>For a \u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c282827c618877817}}\u00a0of spades<\/p>\n\n<p>And his exam results were totally {{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c282831b509153124}}!<\/p>\n\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n<p><strong>Binary guessing<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>How many candies are in the jar? (Write your guess in binary)<\/p>\n\n<p>\u00a0{{interaction_textentryinteraction_5e984c28283c0494652893}}\u00a0<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  ",
